  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How you get there",
     "texto": [
      "The means of transport takes the particle **で**: **バス で いきます** (I go by bus), **でんしゃ で** (by train), **くるま で** (by car).",
      "«On foot» is the exception: **あるいて いきます**, without «で».",
      "To ask: **なに で いきます か** (how do you get there?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How long it takes",
     "texto": [
      "**どのくらい かかります か** = how long does it take? **かかります** means «to take (time)» or «to cost».",
      "Duration is said with **じかん** (hours) and **ふん** or **ぷん** (minutes): **1 じかん**, **20 ぷん**. Don't confuse it with the time on the clock, which is **じ**.",
      "**ぐらい** = about.",
      "**から** = from. **まで** = to: **うち から えき まで** (from home to the station)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the station",
     "texto": [
      "Tickets are flat things, so they are counted with **まい**: **いちまい** (one), **にまい** (two). **きょうと まで いちまい ください** = one ticket to Kyoto, please.",
      "**つぎ** = the next one. Platforms take number + **ばんせん**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
